    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 The Twilight Project  is a third person survival horror game where you play as a tourist who gets lost in a forgotten village sealed off from the outside world. As night falls, strange and terrifying creatures begin to appear, and reality starts to shift into something far darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 You\u2019ll need to survive the night, search for clues, and uncover the dark history behind this cursed place. Some secrets should stay buried... but they might be your only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838790/extras/06db65bcaa9c84a3adfd88c53747f045.avif?t=1753782580\" data-has-big width=800 height=379 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic Horror Experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Immerse yourself in a third-person survival horror adventure with a strong narrative, eerie atmosphere, and haunting visual design inspired by Southeast Asian folklore.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day and Night Dimension System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Survive through shifting realities explore a cursed village by day and confront terrifying creatures from a parallel shadow dimension by night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838790/extras/4f18821d368cf5423276fe7cc29a1be8.avif?t=1753782580\" width=616 height=278 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838790/extras/a393a91edba989683b3a4d9af2ec79df.avif?t=1753782580\" width=616 height=278 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival and Base Defense Mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Establish safe zones, set up traps or tools to defend against nightly attacks. Resources are limited every decision can determine your survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration &amp; Puzzle Solving</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Investigate clues and solve environmental puzzles to uncover the dark secrets of the village and the mysterious legends passed down through generations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit-Infested Village</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Face cursed villagers and ancient demons rooted in Thai folklore and myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
