=616 height=278 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival and Base Defense Mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Establish safe zones, set up traps or tools to defend against nightly attacks. Resources are limited every decision can determine your survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration &amp; Puzzle Solving</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Investigate clues and solve environmental puzzles to uncover the dark secrets of the village and the mysterious legends passed down through generations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit-Infested Village</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Face cursed villagers and ancient demons rooted in Thai folklore and myth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
